      "id": 1,
      "text": "San Juan, Texas, sits in Hidalgo County within the Rio Grande Valley, linking it to the broader McAllen–Edinburg–Mission metro area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        6,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
